true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@komagoma/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2640563, "client_id": 1622191, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcae80b23162f465e02493491f8f88e6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcae80b23162f465e02493491f8f88e6, https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69d0ae473aba6f5a76530e7e26c5db8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8527b00388c22f25b1297b27a1e96bb8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f968f551361c94cd74ee5e94e95d762", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f968f551361c94cd74ee5e94e95d762, https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=981241e6c1485b557dd048ace07f7678 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ecdec17/uploads/origins/449b10b6-6d95-409c-bac2-e388a7bcd972?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4993be778d66b173e98de37f68865295 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I’ve been following your work for a while, and I absolutely love the atmosphere and character designs—they’re wonderful. I would be thrilled if you could illustrate an interaction between my original characters (OCs).\nBelow is a brief summary of the characters’ backstories.\n\n⸻\nKyū (                                                                                                                                                     � The flowers only bloom in an environment where she feels completely at ease.\nShe has a bony wing on one side of her back, from which moss and thin vines hang.\nWhen these spread across her body, it indicates she is in a deep state of hibernation.\n\nCharacter Details\n  •  Two-tone black and white hair, with two stray strands sticking up on top of her head\n  •  Her tail has a cover knitted from yarn\n  •  Her dog ears are decorative (accessories)\n  •  Clothing is patchwork-style with many nature motifs\n  •  I’d love to see fabric with repair marks or visible stitching\n\n———\nShichi (Male): Height 198 cm, appears to be about 40 years old, with a gloomy yet calm demeanor. He is a character who exudes both danger and stability. He is highly possessive and does not like others touching Kyu. In daily life, he often goes about his activities while holding Kyu (changing clothes, eating, resting, etc.). When Kyu is by Shichi’s side, he sleeps more soundly and blooms. Kyu’s moss and vines may touch Shichi’s body, but they do not invade him.\n\nCharacter Details\n  •  Wears gloves at all times due to a condition that petrifies anything he touches\n  •  Scars of various sizes all over his body\n  •  Wears an earring in only one ear\n  •  Long hair, braided down to his waist\n  •  An adult male with a sturdy build\n  •  However, please avoid overly exaggerated musculature\n\n———\nHeight Difference: 156 cm × 198 cm\nNanami cherishes Kyu deeply, but at the same time, he harbors a strong anxiety that Kyu might one day vanish. This fear sometimes causes his emotions to become unstable, leading him to extreme thoughts such as, “If I were to kill him myself, perhaps he could stay by my side forever.”\nHowever, this is not an actual plan; it is a twisted possessiveness stemming from his fear of loss. Kyu’s body temperature is very warm.\n\n\nThank you for taking the time to read this despite your busy schedule. I look forward to your continued support.\n\nhttps://x.com/xijiujiujiu99/status/2029529836205867434?s=61&t=80IbM0OiZOITAB1QOpqmFQ", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@komagoma/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2640563, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f97aa6009e40f9d1d7fa80952476ca5e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f97aa6009e40f9d1d7fa80952476ca5e, https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e827d10bbecd36aeeec193fd2048695c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5aac708f0e120947b4c559ec32e44302 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=963b47fb0280bce3cb968be12ad07d80", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=963b47fb0280bce3cb968be12ad07d80, https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e0318dff56580cbb282ff3967c93c02 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d054e395/uploads/origins/0624a8a4-23ce-43ab-8158-94260650f61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86add08825b8b0d6b55a2c16d17be49f 3x"}, "body": "あなたの絵がとても好きです。私のOC（オリキャラ）のイラストを一枚描いていただけないでしょうか。\n日常寄りの雰囲気でお願いできれば嬉しいです。彼は日本人という設定です。\n\n**用途**\nSNSへの投稿 / 印刷物（友人との共有用）※商用目的はありません。\n\n透明性のある文書を提供できればなお良いです\n\n価格が適切でなければ、再度送ってください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dv17YvDSMI2MtXNECy7ZW--tPrisLd7w?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@komagoma/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2640563, "client_id": 3416833, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f3b15fed42bd515b485861eb81f8973", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f3b15fed42bd515b485861eb81f8973, https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97f4e75e5a76f31ad140de33a0ce8da 2x, https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dfc97abab432e1a86e81bf0f5965e0b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31bbce92042deb0886409adf084620db", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31bbce92042deb0886409adf084620db, https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c01e0cd86329c4bfe71e05d2d8abbd86 2x, https://si.imgix.net/632670ae/uploads/origins/a856c6f0-f6e2-4a97-beb8-0add7abf0c36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfd6bb61dd24fadce3be66d4aa8f89d9 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I fell in love at first sight with your fluid lines and the way you bring characters to life. If you’d be willing, could you please draw one of the original characters from the link? (You can choose whichever one you like.)\nI’ll leave everything up to you, so if your schedule allows, I’d really appreciate it. 🤲\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/122714346", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@komagoma/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2640563, "client_id": 3195820, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c893a2b9fb4449a451ab3ecf0321054", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c893a2b9fb4449a451ab3ecf0321054, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dac625f634e18f4edfa96bf42c5e40f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84ed4d92530b3df271247fa88c95ece7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7762a2d651a96aa191a787e3a5dd605", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7762a2d651a96aa191a787e3a5dd605, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=877a336fde84039753f1cfd9e23caa35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9179cbc/uploads/origins/2b7c59af-6c13-4644-930a-c0541f0d8fbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69571d27eb1e32fafc488d877fc8f02f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Mr. Goma!\nI absolutely love all the fan art you draw! The lively interactions between the characters and their adorable expressions…\nYour understanding of the characters (or actors?) is also really interesting, and I’m completely captivated by it! I think both your colors and lines are beautiful—they feel so free and expressive!\nWould you be willing to draw my two original characters?\n\n▶ Reference/Details\nA handsome detective in men’s clothing and his all-powerful older assistant.\nA villainous duo, a middle-aged married couple. An older man × a beautiful cross-dresser. A good guy and a bad girl. A loud, outgoing partner. A yakuza-turned-detective who loves pranks and his assistant. Friends! Cheers!\n\nTwo wolves. A dog-themed couple. (BG with a BL vibe (?)) A partner-style couple.\n\n△ One-Eyed: Detective. Domineering, polite, and sarcastic. He always uses honorifics. He loves acting and talking. He’s always smiling. He has OCD and prefers things that feel nice to the touch (including ↓), which is why he collects so many stuffed animals.\n\n△ Tanned Skin: The all-powerful assistant who’s great at fighting. He has a Showa-era uncle vibe—ferocious, intimidating, and a bit of a delinquent. But with his wife, he’s just a clumsy, straightforward guy who’s totally trustworthy. He can transform into a werewolf. (Sometimes he can’t control it.) He can transform a little for his partner (fluffy ears and a tail).\n\n▶ (Detailed profile available) URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5yiCmVf35jIV3kuUhgx1Pci7f-809Ih?usp=drive_link\n\n\n▶ Content\n▶ An atmosphere where ordinary people work is fine; a cool villain vibe is fine; a lovey-dovey, goofy couple vibe is fine; a mature atmosphere is fine; a vibe where they’re so close that it feels like they’re not close at all is fine; a comedy manga vibe is fine… and so on.\nPlease feel free to draw whatever interests you. Feel free to choose their outfits and parodies; it’s okay to change them however you like. You can also choose ages other than the parody ones.\nEven something as simple as a doodle page is perfectly fine. I’m really looking forward to seeing the interactions between the characters you draw, your interpretation of them, and more.\n\nBasically, after reviewing the settings, anything goes!\n\nIf you have any rejected roughs or sketches, I’d love to see them.\n\n▶If the budget is insufficient, please let me know so I can adjust it. If that’s difficult, feel free to cancel the order directly.\nThank you very much.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@komagoma/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": fa